{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Asset derived projections",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Only platform and affinity receive this command capability. Native owner matches the stored ID/updatedDate and changes explicit affinity/boost or status fields. Null/missing identity returns the native non-match result. Lost replies are unknown outcomes; no automatic retry or compensation. Payload and reply: 16 KiB. The notification/attachment workflow is not made atomic by this boundary."
  },
